{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world has changed since the invention of airships thirty years ago. The steam-powered airships now fill the sky. Floating islands that were just a speck in the sky are now in reach. Find your way home from the unpredictable sea of clouds and the dangers it holds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong>: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Indie ARPG with quests, crafting and puzzles <br>  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore the open-world in primitive steampunk airships and on foot <br>  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Trade and gather resources  <br>  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Manage the airship <br>  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Fight in airship-to-airship battles and melee and ranged combat <br>  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Play Solo or Split-Screen Co-Op</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1893390/extras/bd58ebfd3bc5c99ffa58bb980468b361.avif?t=1770971877\" width=600 height=125 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1893390/extras/7179b7c30d6e3c16c63e7e9f4beb0363.poster.avif?t=1770971877\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1893390/extras/7179b7c30d6e3c16c63e7e9f4beb0363.webm?t=1770971877\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1893390/extras/7179b7c30d6e3c16c63e7e9f4beb0363.mp4?t=1770971877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1893390/extras/3235caeaf52194a1f0bf00826f8894e8.avif